A||||4||Patrick Horne||N*/Getrag combo question||||1||
Z||000000||Patrick Horne||12-22-2001||06:20 PM||||For all the N* owners and those that aren't:<P>Does anybody know whether the Getrag auto tranny that's in the 86se's will work with the N* engine or not?  Will it be able to handle the power put on it or should I just stick to the 4T80E tranny that came with the caddy?<BR>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Patrick Horne||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||12-22-2001||06:43 PM||||The Getrag is a 5-sp. manual transmission, not an auto.  The Fiero ues a TH-125C auto. tranny (3-sp. w/lock-up torque convertor).  <P>I would strongly urge you to use the auto that is already mated to the N* (unless you are converting it to a manual)......I don't think the Fieros auto. is up to the task. <p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 12-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Patrick Horne||12-22-2001||07:36 PM||||Oh okay, thanks for the info and the correction.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Another question then:  Do I need to use the shifter for the 4T80E tranny from the caddy or can I just use the Fiero's shifter/cabling?  Will there be any problems mating the connections up?<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>Patrick Horne||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||12-22-2001||08:04 PM||||I can't help you out there.  My N* conversion never got past the "I want one" stage.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>There are several people on this forum who have done N* conversions or are in the process of doing one......hopefully someone can help you out. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fiero STS||12-22-2001||11:32 PM||||i am currently working on a northstar conversion. i finished  mounting the engine to the cradle today. i will be working on the shift linkage soon but am planing on modifying the stock shifter and cable to work with the 4t80e trans||||reg||1
